{"rpid": "4786511", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "Albert·Einstein", "mid": "354888", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "在相对论中，E^2=m^2c^4+p^2c^2,p=mv/γ,其中m为物体静质量，γ为洛伦兹乘数,将p与E的表达式代入c·pc/E中化简可得c·pc/E=v", "like": 0, "ctime": 1351930693, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "385430", "video_bvid": "BV1Yx411F7r2", "video_title": "E = MC²是不完整的", "video_desc": "YouTube 介绍 E = MC²的相关内容", "video_owner": "Rapha", "video_view": 49657, "video_reply": 33, "video_n1": 27, "video_n2": 6}
